            },
            "reviewBody": "I love tabbouleh, and this recipe didn't disappoint! I was worried that with the amount of tomato listed that it would be super tomato-foward; but it's actually quite balanced. It does get a little soupy after sitting for awhile, but that's to be expected. I like how simple it was to make, and required basically no cooking! Thank you for sharing your recipe!",
